msgstr "Basahin ang [Transpile fermionic circuits](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) para sa mga yugtong dinaraanan ng isang [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
