msgstr "Tingnan ang [Simulate 1D Fermi-Hubbard dynamics with flow sets](1-d-fermi-hubbard#d-fermi-hubbard) para sa isang gawang halimbawa kung saan ibinibigay ng fermionic formula ang bilang ng step na hindi kayang ibigay ng custom na qubit-side synthesis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consult [`synthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis\") for the synthesis methods themselves, and [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\") for a randomized alternative.\n"
msgstr "Sumangguni sa [`synthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis\") para sa mga synthesis method mismo, at sa [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\") para sa isang randomized na alternatibo.\n"
